# VS Code REST Client: click "Send Request" on each block, top to bottom.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Shorten -> 201, code "1"
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://www.keka.com/careers" }

### 2. Same URL again -> 200, same code (dedupe)
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://www.keka.com/careers" }

### 3. Custom alias -> 201
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://github.com/nestjs/nest", "alias": "nest" }

### 4. Redirect -> 302 Location: https://github.com/nestjs/nest
# (REST Client follows redirects; use curl -i to see the 302)
GET {{base}}/nest

### 5. Stats -> clicks 1
GET {{base}}/urls/nest/stats

### 6. Link that expires in 10 s (GET it after 10 s -> 410 GONE)
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://example.com/otp", "alias": "otp-link", "ttlSeconds": 10 }

###
GET {{base}}/otp-link

### 7. Alias taken -> 409
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://other.com", "alias": "nest" }

### 8. Reserved alias -> 400
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "https://other.com", "alias": "health" }

### 9. Invalid URL and alias -> 400 with both messages
POST {{base}}/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longUrl": "not-a-url", "alias": "a!" }

### 10. Unknown code -> 404
GET {{base}}/doesnotexist

### 11. Delete
DELETE {{base}}/urls/nest
